@C.PREP
Syntax: C.Prep [<opts>] <file.c>
Usage : C preprocessor - phase 1 of the C compiler
Opts  :
  -D<name>   define preprocessor symbol <name>
  -l         emit line-number directives in the output
  -e=<path>  send error messages to <path>
Note  : expands #include, #define and #if, writing the result to
        standard output.  System headers are read from /DD/DEFS/.
        Normally run by CC1/CC2, not directly.
